\]Simplifying, we get \[
a_0 a_1 a_2 \dotsm a_k = \frac{k (k + 1) (k + 2) (k + 3)}{3 \cdot 2^{k + 1}}
\]Letting $k \to \infty$, we find that $a_0 a_1 a_2 \dotsm = \boxed{0}$.

